  m_text: "-----, that was her name, and my name is -------. We were siblings raised
    in the Hayes family. My sister and I grew up in harmony, cherished by our loving
    parents. She always had better stamina than me, but I was the one who excelled
    in playing musical instruments. We loved to compete, always trying to outdo each
    other in our strengths. We were happy back then\u2014life was simpler.\n\n\u2014CC"
